      <activity id="d73e6b13-63f7-522a-a27f-25105bb6ad66" activityNameId="5b2d5ecd-23f1-5f4d-b0c2-69d20c2bb500" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Precast polymer concrete, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Precast polymer concrete, at plant
Modern Swiss und European technologies are applied to building machines, material production and building processes. 
UUID: 3228bfe1-d4b4-4915-8661-d3ee61ac4707
This dataset represents the production of 1 m³ of precast polymer concrete pipe in Germany.
The dataset includes all waste treatment processes arising from the production phase at the precast plant.
The end-of-life treatment of the pipe itself (e.g., demolition, recycling, disposal) is not included and must be accounted for in downstream processes that use this dataset as an input.
Location: Europe
Technology: Production of precast polymer concrete pipe, using industrial machinery
Time period: Review of data currency scheduled after 5 years.
Production volume: 
Sampling: 
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_3228bfe1-d4b4-4915-8661-d3ee61ac4707.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
